msgid "外部工程通过 `NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE` 明确输入，链接 `Nexus::Platform`，由 `nexus_add_firmware()` 装入 startup/system/linker/resource gate。应用只包含公共 Nexus 头和生成 `nexus_factory.h`／`nexus_bindings.h`，不读取 private provider storage 或 SDK register 类型。SPI／I2C controller 和子设备 endpoint 分开获取，controller factory 不得返回第一个子设备的别名。无效 ID 返回 NULL；factory 不初始化、不分配内存。 新调用优先包含每个 Platform bundle 都生成的 `nexus_factory_strong.h`，使用类别独立的 引用常量和 getter；不需要增加配置开关。可选 capability metadata 单独选择。"
msgstr "External projects provide explicit input through `NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE`, link `Nexus::Platform`, and use `nexus_add_firmware()` to install startup/system/linker/resource gates. Applications include only public Nexus headers and generated `nexus_factory.h`/`nexus_bindings.h`; they do not read private provider storage or SDK register types. SPI/I2C controllers and child-device endpoints are obtained separately; a controller factory must not return an alias for its first child. Invalid IDs return NULL; factory lookup neither initializes nor allocates memory. New calls should prefer `nexus_factory_strong.h`, generated by every Platform bundle, with class-specific reference constants and getters. No configuration switch is needed. Optional capability metadata is selected separately."

msgid ""
"平台输入只接受 TOML schema 2，旧 schema 1 JSON 装配必须迁为完整 TOML。 `resolved.json` "
"仅是审计／独立产物检查的单向输出，不能回填生成器。历史证据保留 原字节及只读校验，不重新开放旧配置入口。冷启动仍显式执行 "
"`nx_platform_start()`， 停机执行 `nx_platform_stop()`；BUSY／QUARANTINED "
"时保持状态和所有借用存储。 在 start 前可以保存 face；在成功 stop 后 face 的身份不变，provider 拒绝操作。"
msgstr ""
"Platform input accepts only TOML schema 2; legacy schema 1 JSON "
"assemblies must migrate to complete TOML. `resolved.json` is a one-way "
"output for audit/independent artifact checks and cannot be fed back to "
"the generator. Historical evidence retains original bytes and read-only "
"verification without reopening old configuration entries. Cold startup "
"still explicitly calls `nx_platform_start()` and shutdown calls "
"`nx_platform_stop()`. Preserve state and all borrowed storage on "
"BUSY/QUARANTINED. Faces may be retained before start; after successful "
"stop their identity is unchanged and the provider rejects operations."

msgid ""
"当前 factory／source interface epoch 为 5，`0.2.1` 仍为按精确提交消费的开发快照。 ADC group "
"的直接 `request.frames` 访问迁为 `request.output.frames`；优先使用 "
"`nx_adc_group_prepare()` 设置 RAW 视图，paired 结果由独立 prepare 入口建立。 epoch 3 的公共"
" traits 使用 `nexus/io/traits.h` 中的领域类型；SDIO 请求直接使用 `base`、数据跨度和 function "
"地址，删除 `transfer` 包装及无意义 LBA。旧 epoch 1／2／3／4 不作为兼容 fallback，全部调用者、生成代码和 "
"provider 必须一起重编。 I2C message 和 block request 按方向使用 const TX／mutable "
"RX，优先由各自 write／read 构造或 prepare 入口设置，不能只翻转方向标志。EXTI 按接口绑定来源，UART 原生配置 "
"留在私有边界；CAN 使用逻辑 filter tag，USB Host 使用装配内逻辑 pipe，ADC／DAC "
"查询按公共时间／数字码单位解释。完整字段映射仍由源码兼容性合同统一维护。 epoch 5 将电源 owner 集成移至 "
"`nexus/soc/stm32f4_power.h` 和家族命名入口；hash 查询新增输入／key 长度倍数，必须与地址对齐分别校验。可选 "
"SMBus 绑定由独立 `nexus_smbus_factory.h` 提供，不使普通 factory 依赖组件。精确限制见源码兼容性合同。 "
"epoch 4 将 RS485 的 `direction` 改为 `const nx_gpio_signal_t*`，删除 adapter 配置 "
"的 `mask` 和 `active_high`。GPIO 的单 pin 选择显式声明 `active_high`，再用 "
"`nx_factory_gpio_signal_ref()` 获取只读绑定并检查非 NULL；极性不能从初始电平推导。 手工 signal "
"必须满足授权和生命周期合同，软件总线继续使用物理电平接口。 具体字段与借用步骤见[迁移指南](../guides/migration.md"
"#rebuild-for-source-interface-epoch-5)， 代际、manifest "
"和拒绝规则见[源码兼容性合同](../design/source-compatibility.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The current factory/source interface epoch is 5; `0.2.1` remains a "
"development snapshot consumed by exact commit. Migrate direct ADC group "
"`request.frames` access to `request.output.frames`; prefer "
"`nx_adc_group_prepare()` to set the RAW view, and use the separate "
"prepare entry for paired results. Epoch 3 public traits use the domain "
"types in `nexus/io/traits.h`; SDIO requests directly use `base`, data "
"spans and function addresses, removing the `transfer` wrapper and "
"meaningless LBA. Old epochs 1/2/3/4 are not compatibility fallbacks; "
"rebuild all callers, generated code and providers together. I2C messages "
"and block requests use const TX/mutable RX according to direction; prefer"
" their respective write/read constructors or prepare entries, rather than"
" only flipping the direction flag. EXTI binds its source per interface, "
"and native UART configuration stays private; CAN uses logical filter "
"tags, USB Host uses assembly-local logical pipes, and ADC/DAC queries use"
" public time/digital-code units. The source compatibility contract "
"remains the authority for the complete field mapping. Epoch 5 moves power"
" owner integration to `nexus/soc/stm32f4_power.h` and family-named entry "
"points; hash queries add input/key length multiples, which must be "
"checked separately from address alignment. Optional SMBus bindings are "
"supplied by the separate `nexus_smbus_factory.h`, without adding a "
"component dependency to the ordinary factory. See the source "
"compatibility contract for exact limits. Epoch 4 changes RS485 "
"`direction` to `const nx_gpio_signal_t*` and removes `mask` and "
"`active_high` from the adapter configuration. Explicitly declare "
"`active_high` for a single-pin GPIO selection, then obtain a readonly "
"binding with `nx_factory_gpio_signal_ref()` and check for non-NULL; "
"polarity cannot be inferred from the initial level. Manually assembled "
"signals must satisfy the authorization and lifecycle contracts; software "
"buses continue to use physical-level interfaces. See the [migration "
"guide](../guides/migration.md#rebuild-for-source-interface-epoch-5) for "
"exact fields and borrowing steps, and the [source compatibility "
"contract](../design/source-compatibility.md) for generations, manifests "
"and rejection rules."

msgid ""
"迁移时选择新的 build 目录，重新生成 bundle，并用同一配置、工具链和 ABI 重编全部 调用者、公共 "
"face／ops、factory、provider 与组件。旧工程和构建输出分开保留，不能 混入新的 CMake "
"cache、生成头或目标文件。作者 TOML schema 2、typed IR 代际 5、 factory 代际 5、resolved "
"projection 1 与 SDK manifest schema 2 各自独立，版本号 "
"相同也不能混用不同接口代际。按[现有产品升级步骤](../tutorials/source-sdk.md#upgrade-an-existing-"
"product) 验证所选 SDK 的精确源码身份，再执行产品自己的 Native 合同和选定 MCU 构建。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a new build directory for migration, regenerate the bundle and "
"rebuild all callers, public faces/ops, factory, providers and components "
"with the same configuration, toolchain and ABI. Keep the old project and "
"build outputs separate so they cannot enter the new CMake cache, "
"generated headers or object files. Authored TOML schema 2, typed IR epoch"
" 5, factory epoch 5, resolved projection 1 and SDK manifest schema 2 are "
"independent; matching version numbers do not permit mixing interface "
"generations. Follow the [existing product upgrade steps](../tutorials"
"/source-sdk.md#upgrade-an-existing-product) to verify the selected SDK's "
"exact source identity, then run the product's own Native contracts and "
"selected MCU builds."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/migration.md:32
msgid ""
"请求迁移必须同时更新所有权：prepare 不意味着 accepted，cancel 不意味着 settled。 接受后保持 request 与 payload，到 acquire-"
"observed SETTLED 才能复用。共享 owner 的控制 handle 持有稳定 slot+epoch；不能用一个旧 request 指针取消新 operation。 producer"
" 只提交与等待，唯一执行者持续 service；stop 先关 admission，再 drain 和 join，通知发布者退出前不能回收 notification。"
msgstr ""
"Request migration must update ownership too: prepare does not mean accepted, and cancel does not "
"mean settled. After acceptance, retain request and payload until acquire-observed SETTLED permits "
"reuse. Shared-owner control handles retain stable slot+epoch; an old request pointer cannot cancel"
" a new operation. Producers submit and wait; the sole executor continuously services requests. "
"Stop closes admission before drain/join, and notification storage cannot be reclaimed before "
"publishers exit."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/migration.md:38
msgid ""
"OS storage 使用真实每对象 stack/TCB/depth。任务 entry 返回不等于底层已删除： join 成功后才回收。超时保持 handle、stack 和 "
"TCB。持久化实例拥有外部 workspace； mutating I/O 失败后 reopen 确认 generation，不能凭错误结果推断 commit 未发生。"
msgstr ""
"OS storage uses real per-object stack/TCB/depth. Task-entry return does not mean underlying "
"deletion; storage is reclaimed only after successful join. Timeout retains handle, stack and TCB. "
"Persistent instances own external workspace. After mutating-I/O failure, reopen to confirm "
"generation; an error cannot prove that commit did not occur."

msgid "迁移验收覆盖严格输入负路径、Native/model 行为、维护计划中的精确 ARM ELF 与预算、 完整本地门禁及同源软件候选。可发布 SDK 必须从 clean commit 导出，再验证完整消费 计划；最后按实际 PCB 和接线另行执行 HIL。 外部 `nexus-examples` 是独立示例仓库，平台 CI 不把产品应用加入平台默认目标。"
msgstr "Migration acceptance covers strict negative input paths, Native/model behavior, exact ARM ELFs/resources from the maintained plan, complete local gates and a same-source software candidate. A publishable SDK must be exported from a clean commit and then pass the complete consumer plan. Physical HIL is executed separately against actual PCB/wiring. External `nexus-examples` remains an independent repository; platform CI does not add product applications to default platform targets."
